Generic single-database configuration.

Postgresql
brew install postgresql@18
psql postgres -c "CREATE USER bloguser WITH PASSWORD 'bloguser';"
createdb blog -O bloguser #create a database under the USER
psql blog -U bloguser
\dt #lists tables
\q #exits from database connection

Psycopg is a Postgresql adapter for Python.
uv pip install "psycopg[binary]"

Migrate
alembic revision --autogenerate -m "Initial migration"
alembic upgrade head
